    "text": "las-vegas-news.com\nwebsite\nLas Vegas\nFatal crash shuts down portion of northbound U.S. 95 in northwest valley\nBy William Green,\n1 days agoA fatal crash has forced the closure of a section of northbound U.S. 95 in the northwest valley, causing significant traffic delays and prompting emergency response teams to rush to the scene. Authorities are currently investigating the circumstances surrounding the incident, which resulted in at least one confirmed death.Motorists are advised to seek alternate routes while officials work to clear the area and restore normal traffic flow.\n1",
